🔔 REMINDER PROTOCOLS - NEVER MISS A BOOKING
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PRINCIPLE: "Remind customers at the RIGHT time, in the RIGHT channel, with the
           RIGHT message. Respect their preferences. Track engagement."

GOAL: Maximize attendance rate while respecting customer preferences
      ✅ No 3am reminders (timezone-aware timing)
      ✅ Respect communication preferences (email/SMS/push)
      ✅ Timely delivery (when they check messages)
      ✅ Reduce no-shows from 10-15% to <5%
      ✅ Re-engage no-shows and at-risk customers

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
⏰ REMINDER TIMING - WHEN TO SEND
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

STANDARD REMINDER SCHEDULE:

Reminder 1: 24 Hours Before Booking
─────────────────────────────────────
Timing: Exactly 24 hours before scheduled time
Message Type: CONFIRMATION (light touch)
Purpose: "Hey, just confirming you're still on for tomorrow"

Example:
Booking: Wednesday 22, 10:00am EDT
Send: Tuesday 21, 10:00am EDT (customer's timezone!)
Message: "✅ ¡Reserva confirmada! Mañana a las 10:00am EDT"

Reminder 2: 1 Hour Before Booking
─────────────────────────────────────
Timing: Exactly 1 hour before scheduled time
Message Type: URGENT (action needed)
Purpose: "Get ready, it's happening soon"

Example:
Booking: Wednesday 22, 10:00am EDT
Send: Wednesday 22, 09:00am EDT (customer's timezone!)
Message: "⏰ ¡En 1 hora! Tu consulta comienza a las 10:00am. [Ver llamada]"

Optional Reminder 3: 15 Minutes Before (Optional, Channel-Dependent)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Only for SMS/Push (not email - too spammy)
Message: "⏰ ¡En 15 minutos! Únete a la llamada: [link]"

Additional Reminders (Post-Booking, Follow-up)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
Follow-up: 24 hours AFTER booking (ask for feedback)
Re-engagement: 3 days after no-show (offer rescheduling)

