📱 DELIVERY CHANNELS - HOW TO SEND REMINDERS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

CHANNEL 1: EMAIL
─────────────────
Pros:
✅ Reliable (99%+ delivery)
✅ Rich formatting (links, formatting, attachments)
✅ Searchable (customer can find booking in inbox)
✅ Cheap (bulk rates available)
✅ Accessible (works on all devices)

Cons:
❌ Slow (5-30 min delivery)
❌ Gets lost (spam folder, notifications off)
❌ No click-through tracking (limited)

Best For: 24-hour reminder (customer has time to read)

Example Email:
```
Subject: ✅ Tu reserva confirmada para mañana - Consulta General - 10:00am EDT

Body:
Hola [Name],

¡Confirmamos tu cita para mañana!

📅 DETALLES
Servicio: Consulta General (60 minutos)
Fecha: Miércoles, 22 de octubre de 2025
Hora: 10:00am EDT (Tu zona horaria)

🎥 ÚNETE A LA LLAMADA
[Video Call Link - click here 10 min before]

❓ ¿TIENES PREGUNTAS?
Responde a este email o contacta: support@

⏰ RECORDATORIO FUTURO
Te enviaremos otro recordatorio 1 hora antes.

---
¿No puedes asistir? [Reagendar] [Cancelar]
```


CHANNEL 2: SMS (Text Message)
──────────────────────────────
Pros:
✅ FAST (instant delivery)
✅ High open rate (98%+)
✅ Direct (no spam folder)
✅ Works without data (basic phones)
✅ Urgent feel (good for 1-hour reminder)

Cons:
❌ Limited characters (160)
❌ Expensive (0.01-0.05 USD per SMS)
❌ One-way (no interaction)
❌ May annoy if overused

Best For: 1-hour reminder (time-critical)

Example SMS:
```
⏰ ¡En 1 hora! Tu consulta con [Agent] comienza a las 10:00am EDT.
Únete: [short URL] | Cancelar: Responde STOP
```

Character count: 145 chars ✅


CHANNEL 3: PUSH NOTIFICATIONS (Mobile App)
────────────────────────────────────────────
Pros:
✅ INSTANT delivery
✅ Visible without opening app
✅ High engagement (40-60% tap rate)
✅ Can include action buttons
✅ Works offline (queued)

Cons:
❌ Requires mobile app (not all customers have)
❌ Requires permission
❌ Can be intrusive
❌ More expensive (engineering + infrastructure)

Best For: Both 24h and 1h reminders (if user opted in)

Example Push:
```
Title: "Tu cita es mañana"
Body: "Consulta con [Agent] a las 10:00am EDT. [Enlace]"
```


CHANNEL 4: IN-APP NOTIFICATION
────────────────────────────────
Pros:
✅ Owned channel (your app)
✅ No dependency on 3rd party
✅ Can be very targeted
✅ Cheap (no carrier fees)

Cons:
❌ Only visible if they open app
❌ Easy to dismiss/ignore
❌ No guarantee of seeing it

Best For: Secondary reminder (supplement email)

