🚫 NO-SHOW DETECTION & FOLLOW-UP
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

DEFINE NO-SHOW:

A no-show occurs when:
- Customer doesn't join video call 15 minutes after scheduled time
- AND no cancellation was submitted before booking time
- AND no rescheduling request received

Detection Method:
1. Scheduled time arrives: 10:00am
2. Wait 15 minutes (customer grace period): 10:15am
3. Check video room: Is customer connected?
   - YES: Meeting in progress ✅
   - NO: Mark as NO-SHOW (potential)
4. Send urgent SMS: "Notamos que no conectaste. ¿Todo bien?"
   - Responds "No, cancelar": Mark as CANCELLED
   - Responds with reschedule: Mark as RESCHEDULED
   - No response after 2 hours: Mark as NO-SHOW ✅

NO-SHOW TRACKING:

```
Customer Profile:
├─ Total bookings: 15
├─ No-shows: 2
├─ No-show rate: 13% (concerning)
├─ Last no-show: Oct 15, 2025
└─ Trend: Increasing (was 5% in Q3)
```

NO-SHOW IMPACT:

TIER 3+ (Power customers):
- 1st no-show: Friendly reminder
- 2nd no-show: Phone call + re-engagement offer
- 3rd no-show: Booking deposit required ($25)

TIER 1-2 (Regular customers):
- 1st no-show: Friendly follow-up + reschedule offer
- 2nd no-show: Move to AT-RISK tier

AT-RISK (Already problematic):
- Any no-show: Special attention + phone call

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📞 FOLLOW-UP SEQUENCE AFTER NO-SHOW
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

IMMEDIATE (within 2 hours):

Step 1: Urgent SMS (ATTEMPT 1)
"Notamos que no conectaste a tu cita de hoy a las 10:00am.
¿Todo está bien? ¿Quieres reagendar?
[Sí, reagendar] [No, cancelar] [Llamarme]"

Step 2: Wait 30 minutes for response
- If responds "Sí, reagendar": Show availability immediately
- If responds "No, cancelar": Mark as cancelled
- If responds "Llamarme": Agent calls within 1 hour
- If NO RESPONSE: Continue to Step 3

Step 3: Email (within 2 hours of no-show)
Subject: "❓ ¿Qué pasó con tu reserva de hoy?"

Body:
"Hola [Name],

Notamos que no conectaste a tu cita de hoy a las 10:00am EDT.

¿Todo está bien? 😟

Si hubo un problema:
- [Reagendar fácilmente]
- [Llamarme para hablar]
- [Cancelar sin cargo]

Estamos aquí si necesitas ayuda.

[Support contact info]"

FOLLOW-UP (24 hours later, if no response to Step 3):

Step 4: Phone Call Attempt (Agent outreach)
"Hola [Name], soy [Agent] de [Company].
Te llamaba para ver qué pasó ayer con tu reserva.
¿Podemos reagendar? Te ofrecemos descuento..."

DELAYED FOLLOW-UP (3 days after no-show):

Step 5: Re-engagement Offer (Email)
Subject: "🎁 Descuento para reagendar tu reserva"

Body:
"Hola [Name],

Nos gustaría ayudarte a reagendar tu cita.

🎁 OFERTA ESPECIAL: 20% descuento si bookas esta semana
   Código: REAGENDAR20

✅ Nuevos horarios disponibles:
   - Jueves 23, 2:00pm
   - Viernes 24, 10:00am
   - Lunes 27, 3:00pm

[Ver disponibilidad]

Si tienes dudas, llámanos: [PHONE]"

LONG-TERM (7+ days after no-show):

Step 6: Win-Back Campaign (if still no response)
- Remove from regular mailing list (respect wishes)
- Add to "inactive" segment
- Send monthly win-back email (low frequency)
- Offer special incentive if they rebook

